 "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Salakapakka", "keywords": ["salakapakka", "kieltolaki", "opetus"], "long_description": "Kurkista historiaan Samsung Gear VR-lasien avulla!\n\n1920-luku, Helsinki. Kieltolaki rajoittaa ihmisten el\u00e4m\u00e4\u00e4, mutta viina virtaa silti laittomissa salakapakoissa. \n\nOmaksu etsiv\u00e4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=se538K0uF8QQ7kNvwGHhUdd&_nc_oc=AdoC3TpvBAzddblihApOw2jk7VCdlnlv46IMc8uiJ81vY-HgoJOFvPMVCFmHNy_SpGY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT_oqWJDgTRaWxTMau5j9HxJqDsVr9NuuTit-69I7_VSw&oe=6B007D94"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4PGOW8wDaHoQ7kNvwF22o0x&_nc_oc=AdrwMVsGQh45pKkI0OedqPiBjr35oMNlYzORB_z2vwHo7JGyiNN2-Wq4xkbal-v3f1E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTKsA2XFOAvj-JMYp2AZ-4i3h8crgsvpODcXF7H3HyI8A&oe=6B008272"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_IC